471.0566418170929,
538.7109160423279,
480.06054925918585
],
"fontSize": 9.003907442092952
},
{
"text": "adverse plaque characteristics, including positive remodeling, low-attenuation plaque, spotty calcification, and napkin-ring sign. The RS in",
