534.1113209724426,
470.1191382408142
],
"fontSize": 9.003907442092896
},
{
"text": "patients ranged from 0.46 to 3.17. HR = hazard ratio, HRP = high-risk plaque, NA = not applicable, RS = radiomic signature.",
