54.4824242591858,
451.0859595537186,
492.82225370407104,
460.0898580551148
],
"fontSize": 9.00389850139618
},
{
"text": "* HR was adjusted for clinical variables, including age, sex, body mass index, hypertension, clinical presentation, diabetes, smoking,",
